print(arr.reshape(2,3))

Output

[[1 2 3]
 [4 5 6]]


---

ravel()

Converts a multi-dimensional array into a 1D array.

arr.ravel()


---

flatten()

Returns a copy of the array as a 1D array.

arr.flatten()


---

transpose()

Converts rows into columns.

